a level while they're doing that?</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;You want to go up a level so you can get sneak attacked?&quot;<br /> <br /> \u200b(My assessment of Lunars is up, please tell me if I've missed anything.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T12:44:25-07:00","id":1336622,"title":"","content":"Fantastic, thanks this is exactly what I needed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>while (horse.state == dead)<br /> {<br /> beat();<br /> }","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/830-amdramnar","name":"Amdramnar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T12:56:39-07:00","id":1336629,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1335355-in-which-alucard-discusses-personas-exalted-3e?p=1336025#post1336025\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u200b(My assessment of Lunars is up, please tell me if I've missed anything.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Where did you post it?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T13:21:24-07:00","id":1336639,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1335355-in-which-alucard-discusses-personas-exalted-3e?p=1336629#post1336629\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Where did you post it?</div> </div> </div> </div>In the same one as the Terrestrial Exalted, since it's where he said he'd cover &quot;other Exalted&quot;.<br /> <br /> Not that there currently are others besides those two.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":636,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","user":"Sunder the Gold","date":". 09-19-2019, 10:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T13:46:03-07:00","id":1336646,"title":"","content":"Ah, thanks.<br /> <br /> I'm a big fan of Sublime Facade Art. Mostly for thieves, tbh; Larceny isn't an ability that Lunars generally get a ton out of compared to, say, Brawl, Survival or Occult. Works well for actors too.<br /> Admittedly, a lot of characters who are into Manipulation are probably going to have Socialise for the social influence anyway. The Lunar in my game who has it does; but his Larceny is higher, and I think even just the +1 to his Guile he's ended up gettng from it, being non-charm, 0motes and permanent, is worth 8xp.<br /> At least, +1 Guile is for a conman like him.<br /> <br /> I also really enjoy Will-Drowning Void. Not because I think it's super-evocative (though arguably Will-Shattering Mystery is), I just enjoy the revenge against anyone reading my characters' intentions. Kind of trolly, really.<br /> <br /> <br /> I think it's also worth noting that with Moonlight Curtain Drawn, if you don't do a stunt you're only going to get +2 out of it at most, not +3. I don't think this is a huge issue (as it's scene-long, it's probably still worth it), but it's something people buying it should be aware of.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T14:49:25-07:00","id":1336674,"title":"","content":"Seems to me that Shadow-Mind Meditation is only minimally compatible with Silver Mask Submersion.<br /> <br /> If you use the shadow-mind before submerging under your mask, the shadow-mind's Intimacies will replaced with those of the mask, but the mask persona will be protected and restrained by the shadow-mind's negativity, and will have the social and mental Attribute ratings of the Dark Premise Duality. The mask persona won't necessarily know they're a shadow-mind with the possibility to meditate away the cynicism.<br /> <br /> Using shadow-mind AFTER submerging under a mask, again, requires your mask persona to realize they can even do that. If they do, your shadow-mind persona should completely supplant the mask persona. Being in the shadow-mind should completely negate any effect of being in the mask persona, except that the mask persona retains the power to decide it doesn't want the shadow-mind in charge anymore and spending four hours wrestling it back under the hood. The shadow-mind is fully aware that it can shapeshift, and can make the mask-persona aware that it can shapeshift.<br /> <br /> <br /> A Lunar who knows both Charms can play at being Fei Long, of <i>Xenogears</i>.<br /> <br /> The original Fei, the Coward, uses shadow-mind to make his dark persona to take the pain for him. Eventually things get so bad that one or the other takes on another form and uses Silver Mask Submersion, becoming someone who remembers nothing except that his name is Fei.<br /> <br /> Sometimes Fei loses control and the dark-mind rises up to deal with the problems with all the powers he knows he has.<br /> <br /> Eventually, Fei learns what he needs to learn to end Silver Mask Submersion, reintegrating with the Coward to become one whole Fei.<br /> <br /> <br /> Squint, and this is also Naruto, with his Kyubi dark-mind and his old Hokage self (his &quot;father&quot; Namikaze).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-01T11:03:42-07:00","id":1338841,"title":"","content":"Sunder: That's a good example of Shadow-Mind Meditation.<br /> <br /> I think a good literary example of Solar Persona Charms is Shallan Davar from The Stormlight Archive, complete with difficulty telling personalities apart. (Without spoilers, a key moment in the third book, Oathbringer, is something I would like to replicate with Socialize Charms.)<br /> <br /> Another example of Shadow-Mind Meditation is Killia/Killidia from Disgaea 5.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3551-ulthwithian","name":"Ulthwithian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}